{"id":"prepositions-0005","taskId":"prepositions","title":"Drill set 5","text":null,"source":"drill","gaps":[{"answer":"about","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"She\u0027s always cared deeply ___ animal welfare.","hint":"care ___ sth (be concerned)","explanation":"care ABOUT = think it matters; care FOR = look after or like."},{"answer":"for","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Is there any excuse ___ being so rude?","hint":"excuse ___ sth","explanation":"an excuse FOR something/doing something."},{"answer":"of","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Police suspect him ___ faking the documents.","hint":"suspect sb ___ sth","explanation":"suspect somebody OF something/doing something."},{"answer":"for","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Please forgive me ___ interrupting.","hint":"forgive sb ___ sth","explanation":"forgive somebody FOR something/doing something."},{"answer":"in","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Over two hundred athletes participated ___ the marathon.","hint":"participate ___ sth","explanation":"participate IN an event (also: take part in)."},{"answer":"on","accept":[],"options":["at","by","in","on"],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"The film is based ___ a true story.","hint":"based ___","explanation":"\u0027Based on\u0027 = developed from."},{"answer":"of","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Doctors say stress is a major cause ___ insomnia.","hint":"cause ___ sth","explanation":"the cause OF something."},{"answer":"at","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"He\u0027s very good ___ solving puzzles.","hint":"good ___ doing","explanation":"good/bad/brilliant AT an activity."}]}